        "TileImage": "$($repository ffa05f01-d6f4-4578-864d-54c09abe40e0).Image",
        "Description": "Bonjour 47, \r\rCette semaine, tu es envoy&#233; &#224; Paris, o&#249;—oh, sorry, I switched to French - Julee Voclain and her crew have sneaked into a Paris fashion show, playing hidden roles to get a piece of the big prize. \r\rThe Sheikh is also in town—maybe his outfit could give you a sly Advantage. \r\rAfter all, sometimes in Paris, the unexpected happens. Julee is the main target, but remember, we must take out all five members of her team. \r\rStay sharp and bonne chance, 47.\r\r-Twiice",
